# ADR-033-4 Action vocabulary (issue #415): unify every Integration leg on
# integrationOperation with one Action convention (helper supplies
# connection/secrets/deadline/operationId; each leg takes what its Action
# needs); required-vs-optional derives from the Saga definition plus the
# integration ID, so call sites pass no required list and branch on no
# required/optional shape; helper signatures reject runtime-policy knobs;
# vendor-neutral helper names (lexicon). Slice A landed the guardrails;
# Slice B migrates the six legs (echo, ninjaone-orgs, digest x2,
# cloudflare-verify, cloudflare-inventory) and retires the private
# resolveCloudflareVendor passthrough. Terminals, prepare, and adapters ride
# #416 (one Saga per PR); no new primitive, no policy knobs, no DSL.
scopes/adr033-4-action-vocabulary.scope
src/saga-helpers.ts
src/sagas/echo.ts
src/sagas/ninjaorgs.ts
src/sagas/digest.ts
src/sagas/cloudflare.ts
test/saga-helpers.test.ts
test/saga-helper-conventions.test.ts
